# Superpowers/Codex isolated implementation worktrees
/.worktrees/

# ...but the PUBLIC code-signing certificate MUST be committed (app bundles it to
# verify OTA manifests). This negation overrides the global `*.pem` ignore above.
!client/certs/
!client/certs/certificate.pem

